1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,709
Here are the six Spirit cards. You use one each time you play your Spirit Power card, choosing between the two on top of the piles.

2
00:00:08,366 --> 00:00:17,838
The Bear clears the bowl. Put all of its stones back in the bag, draw the same number of new ones, and take one. Perfect when the bowl is full of colors you don't need.

3
00:00:18,499 --> 00:00:22,745
The Wolf adds four stones to the bowl, then you take one. Lots of choice.

4
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:32,487
The Ram draws two stones from the bag and puts them straight on your board. You must place both if you can. Whatever doesn't fit goes into the bowl. It's a gamble!

5
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:38,670
The Eagle lets you take one stone, and after you recover your cards, you play another whole turn.

6
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:45,221
The Deer moves one of your own stones back to the bowl, then you take two. Great for fixing a mistake.

7
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:55,414
The Bison adds three stones and you take one. Then you return any stone from the bowl to the bag. Even a Spirit Stone, to keep the game going a little longer.

8
00:00:56,066 --> 00:00:59,757
Do the steps in the order written, then slide the card under its pile.
